\newlabel{tab:s2_cek}{{S1.3}{6}{Version-controlled analysis plans by group of rounds (rounds on the same patients and folds or on simulations, plus the Emotiv cohort in rounds 50, 53, 57, and 58; every plan was written after the results of earlier rounds were known, so all rounds are follow-up analyses; the optimism correction, \tabref {tab:optimisme}, covers only stored candidates). Add.\ = addendum; hash = first 12 characters of the SHA-256 of the parent document of each round (``--'': Git commit); a hash identifies a document but does not establish when it was written. Grp.\ = independent check groups (second implementation, perturbation of test data and labels, reproduction of stored cells, recomputation of summaries) passed per round; rounds 55--60 were checked by exact reproduction of stored cells before the run, not by a second implementation (S2.13--S2.18).\relax }{table.3}{}}
