\newlabel{tab:kaliper}{{S2.4}{14}{AUC (percent) within year $\times $ device strata with an age caliper: only epilepsy--non-epilepsy patient pairs from the same cell and with an age difference of up to $k$ years. Scores were averaged over 10 repetitions; no model was retrained. The top rows give the number of pairs and the patient bootstrap 95\% CI (2,000 replicates) for F2.\relax }{table.4}{}}
